## Downloading UC04a corpus

Download each URL and save using the **UC04a filename** in the table below.
Target directory: `data/uc04a/data-sources/`.

```bash
# Example for one file:
curl -sS -A "normain-benchmarks kh.hansson@gmail.com" \
  "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/..." \
  -o data/uc04a/data-sources/<uc04a-filename>
```

SEC EDGAR rate-limit: keep requests under ~10/sec. Add `sleep 0.1` between downloads.

